{
  "html": "<div class=\"page\">\n  <div class=\"r\" style=\"grid-column:1/9;grid-row:1/2\"><div class=\"kicker\">02 · 场景价值决定投入优先级</div></div>\n\n  <div class=\"r\" style=\"grid-column:1/8;grid-row:2/4\">\n    <div class=\"t1\">供应链AI应先打通跨环节数据</div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"r bot right\" style=\"grid-column:9/13;grid-row:2/4\">\n    <div class=\"kicker\">供应链场景价值</div>\n    <div class=\"c\">数据源→打通→协同→价值</div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"r\" style=\"grid-column:1/13;grid-row:4/7\">\n    <div class=\"flow\">\n      <div class=\"node\">\n        <div class=\"k\">数据源</div>\n        <div class=\"t3\">采购、生产</div>\n        <div class=\"s\">关键主数据分散在不同业务环节</div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"arrow\">→</div>\n      <div class=\"node\">\n        <div class=\"k\">打通</div>\n        <div class=\"t3\">统一关键主数据</div>\n        <div class=\"s\">需求预测与流程协同成为共同基础</div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"arrow\">→</div>\n      <div class=\"node\">\n        <div class=\"k\">协同</div>\n        <div class=\"t3\">采购、生产、物流和销售联动</div>\n        <div class=\"s\">升级传统业务流程、组织架构和经营模式</div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"arrow\">→</div>\n      <div class=\"node end\">\n        <div class=\"k\">价值</div>\n        <div class=\"t3\">共同指标驱动投入</div>\n        <div class=\"s\">围绕库存、现货率和自动化率建立共同指标</div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"r lt\" style=\"grid-column:1/7;grid-row:7/9\">\n    <div class=\"t3\">战略需求分析先行</div>\n    <div class=\"s\">企业布局大模型前通常全方位开展战略需求分析，统筹所需资源，为落地应用提供支撑。</div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"r lt\" style=\"grid-column:7/13;grid-row:7/9\">\n    <div class=\"t3\">需求分析支撑资源配置</div>\n    <div class=\"s\">需求分析有助于探索产品迭代和服务升级路径，并为决策制定、资源配置和研发测试奠定基础。</div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"source\">资料来源：中国信息通信研究院《人工智能发展报告（2024年）》第 45 页</div><div class=\"pageno\">13</div>\n</div>",
